# Customer.Api — sistemi Aspire AppHost ile başlat (portlar launchSettings'ten; Aspire dashboard'da doğrula)
# Tüm uçlar CurrentUser ister: client_credentials token'ında sub olmadığından
# WebApp oturumundan kullanıcı bearer'ını kopyalayıp {{token}} yerine yapıştırmak gerekebilir.
@baseAddress = https://localhost:7251
@identity = https://localhost:5001
@id = 3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afac

### Token al (client_credentials — scope: customer.read customer.write)
POST {{identity}}/connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=client_credentials&client_id=ecommerce.bff&client_secret=webshop-secret&scope=customer.read customer.write

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.access_token); %}

### --- Adres Defteri (AddressBook) ---

### Adresleri getir (customer.read)
GET {{baseAddress}}/api/v1/addresses
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Adres ekle (customer.write) — UserId token'dan çözülür
POST {{baseAddress}}/api/v1/addresses
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "province": "İstanbul",
  "district": "Kadıköy",
  "street": "Bağdat Cad.",
  "zipCode": "34710",
  "line": "No 12 D3"
}

### Adres güncelle (customer.write)
PUT {{baseAddress}}/api/v1/addresses/{{id}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "province": "İstanbul",
  "district": "Üsküdar",
  "street": "Çengelköy",
  "zipCode": "34680",
  "line": "No 5"
}

### Adres sil (customer.write)
DELETE {{baseAddress}}/api/v1/addresses/{{id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Varsayılan adres yap (customer.write)
POST {{baseAddress}}/api/v1/addresses/{{id}}/default
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### --- Kayıtlı Kartlar (Wallet) ---

### Kartları getir (customer.read) — maskeli döner, PAN asla dönmez
GET {{baseAddress}}/api/v1/cards
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Kart ekle (customer.write) — PAN tokenize edilir, saklanmaz
POST {{baseAddress}}/api/v1/cards
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "pan": "4111111111111111",
  "cvv": "123",
  "expiryMonth": 12,
  "expiryYear": 2030,
  "label": "İş kartım"
}

### Kart sil (customer.write)
DELETE {{baseAddress}}/api/v1/cards/{{id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Varsayılan kart yap (customer.write)
POST {{baseAddress}}/api/v1/cards/{{id}}/default
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}